  "id": "quantitative-analysis",
  "term": "quantitative analysis",
  "definition": "Quantitative analysis is the examination of phenomena using numerical measures, such as scale scores, to identify patterns or relationships among variables. In this context, it refers to analyzing measured aspects like identity, language proficiency, and linguistic behavior.",
